  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/670/642/goblintraders_banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1100\" height=\"270\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/502/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"Forge\" width=\"99\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/504/mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"需要 Framework\" width=\"222\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.mrcrayfish.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/500/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"MrCrayfish&#x27;s 网站\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/MrCrayfishMinecraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/499/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"MrCrayfish&#x27;s YouTube\" width=\"119\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/mrcrayfish\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/336389026586165261?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Discord&logoColor=902121\" alt=\"MrCrayfish&#x27;s Discord\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">⚠️ <strong>Minecraft 1.20.1 及更高版本的 Goblin Traders 现已需要 <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/503/244/icon.png\" alt=\"Framework 图标\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/framework\" rel=\"nofollow\">Framework</a></strong></p>\n<h5>📖 <strong>关于</strong></h5>\n<p>Goblin Traders 是一款简单的模组，添加了拥有独特交易的哥布林。与流浪商人类似，哥布林会随机生成在地下的洞穴或下界中，并提供专属且有益的交易，助你提升冒险体验！本模组添加了两位新的商人：生成于主世界的“哥布林商人”和生成于下界的“矿脉哥布林商人”，两者均拥有各自独特的交易列表。这些小家伙脾气不小，不喜欢被你攻击。如果你愿意大方一点，可以喂它们最喜欢的食物来触发有趣的动画。</p>\n<h5>📦 <strong>整合包开发者</strong></h5>\n<p>Goblin Traders 已内置通过数据包修改交易的功能。如需了解更多，请查阅<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goblin-traders/pages/how-to-modify-trades\" rel=\"nofollow\">详细指南</a>了解如何修改交易。指南中还附有示例数据包供你下载。</p>\n<h5>🎨 <strong>截图</strong></h5>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/510/242/newscreenshot1a.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/510/243/newscreenshot2a.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/510/244/newscreenshot3.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"632\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/510/245/newscreenshot4.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"632\"></strong></p>\n<h5>🙋 <strong>需要支持或想关注模组开发进展？</strong></h5>\n<p>评论区不太适合提供技术支持，因此 MrCrayfish 推荐你加入<a href=\"https://discord.gg/mrcrayfish\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xN1MMCY.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"24\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;Discord 社区</span></a>。你可以在这里获得安装、配置模组以及解决崩溃等问题的帮助！此外，你还能第一时间获取模组更新与开发相关的资讯。<strong>点击下方横幅加入 🔽</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/mrcrayfish\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/639/926/discordbanner.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"88\"></a></p>",
